Sval: tab previews stop counting popups that are no longer open

TabHoverPanelSet counts a panel or menupopup as open from its
popupshowing to its popuphiding, seeds the count with panels marked
panelopen or animating, and shows no tab preview while any is counted. A
popup can close with no popuphiding: its popupshowing was cancelled, it
was removed from the document while open, or it was seeded closed but
still marked animating, which panel.js clears only on popupshown. Any of
these kept the window from showing a tab preview again. A counted popup
that is closed or out of the document is dropped before the check.

